From 5d81a1ee402db7158eb0f6105c11bd817140c442 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 08:49:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Real audio player on the mixes page

- /api/stream resolves a fresh HearThis stream URL per play and
  redirects, so mixes play in our own transport bar while the play
  still counts on HearThis and costs us no bandwidth.
- /api/mixcloud pulls the Mixcloud channel live, so that tab is no
  longer empty; Mixcloud keeps its widget since it publishes no
  open audio URL.
- SoundCloud tab falls back to the full channel player.
- Docked player: play/pause, prev/next, seek, time, volume, mute,
  spacebar, queue and auto-advance.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01P3jJB46vNhDVRfT73zKnE8
